## Note on Shizuku naming restrictions

Shizuku's README forbids derivative use of its name, application id, permission
strings and icons. EQO therefore renames the application id and the
`moe.shizuku.manager.permission.*` strings in lockstep (TASK-007, D-004 as
corrected) and keeps Shizuku attribution in this file and the in-app notices
screen. Trademark interpretation of those naming terms requires the owner's
sign-off before any public distribution; a private study build is not blocked
by it (FEASIBILITY-REPORT.md §6).

